<title>USA: Va. $30.6 mln taxable housing deal won by Suntrust.</title>
<headline>Va. $30.6 mln taxable housing deal won by Suntrust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suntrust Capital Markets said Thursday it won $30.6 million Virginia Housing Development Authority taxable bonds at a true interest cost of 7.72 percent.</p>
</text>
